      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02123",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 古歌：“谁与话当年？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: With whom can I speak of those bygone years?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02123",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "亲友尽凋零。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "All my close friends have faded away.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02123",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "苍松虽长寿，亦已非故人。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Though the green pine lives long, it too is no longer the old companion I knew.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02123",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "见《古今和歌集》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in the Kokin Wakashu.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
